  info: "Ants are eusocial insects in the order Hymenoptera. They can live in colonies
    consisting of millions of individuals. Ant societies exhibit division of labor,
    communication between individuals, and the ability to solve complex problems.
    The main castes in ant colonies include workers, soldiers, drones, and queens.
    Ant colonies have often been described as \u201Csuperorganisms,\u201D as individuals
    operate together as a unified entity to support the colony.\n\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ant "
  image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 6b3d61ec34ff16f4082d0a5e1d94710a, type: 3}
